Subject: [PATCH 11/13] nyxhop/zynq: the NyxHop baseboard v0.2
 (nyxhop-bb.config): the board's ICM-42688-P (roll 180), CH1..8, GPS1 ttyPS1 +
 GPS2 ttyS2, CRSF on ttyS0, ADS1115 battery (AIN0 VBAT/11, battery_status),
 compass/baro probed on the two external I2C (buses 11/12, links made to the
 real ones), MAVLink on TELEM1 ttyS1; ADS1115, battery_status, crsf_rc,
 rc_input, IST8310/QMC5883L/HMC5883, MS5611/BMP388/DPS310/SPL06 built

---
 boards/nyxhop/zynq/default.px4board   | 11 ++++
 boards/nyxhop/zynq/nyxhop-bb.config   | 88 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 boards/nyxhop/zynq/src/board_config.h |  9 ++-
 boards/nyxhop/zynq/src/i2c.cpp        |  5 +-
 4 files changed, 109 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 boards/nyxhop/zynq/nyxhop-bb.config

